{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>Who</b> — an addition, and it is because the Third House will stand, and he did not mention 'mighty warrior' because of \"they shall beat their swords into plowshares,\" and the earth will be quiet from all war." "<b>And the meaning of YHWH of hosts</b> — that the people of the generation will be like the angels of HaShem." "<b>And the meaning of YHWH of hosts</b> — that the Name is called thus because of the host of heaven, as I explained, not because of the host of Israel as the Gaon [Saadia] said."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:28:29.280856462Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}